        "br" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⠠⠞⠓⠑ ⠁⠏⠏ ⠊⠎ ⠗⠥⠝⠝⠊⠝⠛⠲ ⠠⠍⠊⠛⠗⠁⠞⠊⠕⠝ ⠓⠁⠎⠝⠄⠞ ⠎⠞⠁⠗⠞⠑⠙⠂ ⠁⠝⠙ ⠞⠓⠑ ⠁⠏⠏ ⠊⠎ ⠎⠞⠊⠇⠇ ⠊⠝ ⠊⠞⠎ ⠕⠗⠊⠛⠊⠝⠁⠇ ⠇⠕⠉⠁⠞⠊⠕⠝⠲"
