        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These apps are stored on “%@”, which does not support:\n\n%@\n\nThey were copied there during migration, when these items could already not be preserved. Restoring copies this same bundle back to the internal disk, but cannot recover what was already lost — and once the restore completes, the external original is deleted, making the gap permanent.\n\nIf these apps depend on permissions or access control, consider not restoring now and reinstalling the official build instead."
